WEBVTT

00:01:00.139 --> 00:01:02.225
The solution was simple:

00:01:02.225 --> 00:01:04.393
a solar water pump.

00:01:04.769 --> 00:01:07.730
But that would cost $10,000.

00:01:08.189 --> 00:01:10.066
And for a community

00:01:10.066 --> 00:01:13.611
where the average household earned

00:01:13.611 --> 00:01:17.824
just about $70 a month,

00:01:17.824 --> 00:01:21.536
this was beyond their affordability.

00:01:23.037 --> 00:01:27.041
As I sat there thinking about this issue,

00:01:27.041 --> 00:01:31.170
the solution literally walked
in front of me.